# Normalize text source files to Unix (LF) line endings.
# `.rustfmt.toml` sets `newline_style = "Unix"`, so a CRLF checkout makes
# `cargo fmt --check` fail on line endings alone.
*.rs   text eol=lf

# Web assets are plain text and already LF in-tree; keep them normalized.
# Other text types (e.g. *.ftl which is Crowdin-managed, *.slint, *.toml, *.md)
# are intentionally omitted: declaring them while CRLF is still present in-tree
# would trigger a large renormalization on the next `git add`/checkout.
*.js   text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
